{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fdaec53f-d0cc-8738-9c71-690909920658",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T14:23:54-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:20:55-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:20:58-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yes, hello, my name is Holly Gifford. I'm calling about a street that hasn't been plowed. Sorry, I'm on speakerphone, I'm at the farmers market and I'm standing by my truck so I can hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:21:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you okay. Which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:21:19-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm not calling about my own house. It's my neighbor, la señora next door, she's in her eighties. Perdón. She lives alone and she can't get out. There's still a hard bank of snow and ice at the end of her driveway where the plow went by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:21:38-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And that's left over from the storm, or older than that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:21:43-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's from before. Then we had the rain Friday into Saturday, two days ago, and it all froze up again overnight. So now it's like cement. [line breaks up] She needs a path, even just one lane, for if somebody has to come get her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:01-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up for a second. You said she needs a path for what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:08-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For if an ambulance or a, um, a ride comes. Or her aide. Una persona who comes in the mornings. Sorry, I switch back and forth when I'm talking fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:20-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize at all. So I do need the street name to get this on a list. Is it a city street or a private road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:31-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a city street. I'd rather not say the address over the speaker here, there's people all around. Can I just give you my phone number and you call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:43-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead with the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:46-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0178. Holly Gifford."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:22:49-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0178, Holly Gifford. I'll note it's an elderly resident who's stuck behind packed snow at the end of the driveway. When we call you back we'll get the street and the house number from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:04-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And do you know when it would be cleared? Like today, or tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:11-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Plowing crews can clear the street itself, but a driveway apron is sometimes handled differently. Once I have the location I'll flag it for the supervisor today, and I'd expect somebody to look at it within a day or so. Someone will call you either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:29-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A day or so. Bueno. That's what I needed to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:34-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the meantime, if she has any kind of emergency, she should call 911 and not wait on us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:42-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I know. I'll tell her. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:46-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Holly. Enjoy the market, and keep your phone on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T14:23:51-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye now."
    }
  ],
